  "status": 200,
  "payload": {
    "id": "usr_99",
    "value": 750
  }
}

Tell me, friend, if we cast aside the 'warnings' as mere noise, do we not risk ignoring the very truth of the machine's condition? Is a thing truly 'essential' simply because it fits within your small box?

{
  "mappings": [
    {
      "dept_formal_name": "Human Resources",
      "alias": "The folk in Human Resources"
    },
    {
      "dept_formal_name": "Finance",
